stdout:
reference[72]: "  [--resources TEXT] [--label key=value ...] [--adapter none|kind|k3d|compose]","  [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--protect-live-owner] [--key K] [--pending [--name HANDLE]]","  [--idle D] [--max-lifetime D] [--quiet | -q] [--axi | --json]","Owner defaults to DIBS_OWNER, then pid:<parent-pid>. pid and session pin","process start time; session:<holder-pid> follows a session-holding process,","not a Unix SID. heartbeat:<path> must already be a fresh regular file.","exec:<command> (DIBS_EXEC_OWNER=1 or \"exec_owner\": true) runs the command with","/bin/sh from / with a 10s timeout: exit 0 alive, 1-125 dead, anything else unknown.",kind and k3d create uniquely named clusters; kind uses a private kubeconfig.,compose creates,a uniquely named project with a durable resolved config. none records metadata,only and performs no external cleanup. up is an alias.,"--protect-live-owner: sweep never reclaims while the owner is alive or unknown,",even after expiry; only proven owner death reclaims. Use the worker's own owner.,"Requires DIBS_LIVE_OWNER_PROTECTION=1 or \"live_owner_protection\": true.","--key K and --pending need the consumer contract (DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1).","--key K: retries match owner, protection, adapter, mode, pinned handle, Docker scope, and Compose file; TTL, description, and labels are ignored.","With --pending or --key, --quiet prints only the lease ID (including on retry);",exit codes distinguish success from failure. --quiet cannot combine with --axi,or --json for those contract creates. Without these flags it keeps its usual behavior.,"--pending records the lease before the caller creates a kind, k3d or Compose",resource in the selected Docker context; the caller then stamps the label,io.dibs.lease=<id> or uses the handle pinned with --name (which must not exist,"yet), and runs dibs adopt <type> <handle> --pending <id>. Release and sweep","of a pending lease bind its single match first, so a crash still reclaims.","Statuses: created, recorded, already_done.","Examples:","  dibs create --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h --resources '2 CPUs, test lab'","  dibs create --adapter kind --owner session:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs create --adapter compose --file compose.yaml --label task=lab","  dibs create --adapter kind --pending --name lab-7 --key task-7:lab --quiet","",Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest,when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes an unprotected,"lease reclaimable, so its live owner can lose its resources by missing either","cadence. With --protect-live-owner, only proven owner death reclaims; a late",extend with a live owner reattaches when the resource is still present.,"","Lease policies are off until DIBS_LEASE_POLICIES=1 or \"lease_policies\": true.","While on, the policies table in the user config picks each new lease's rule by","resource kind, or kind/owner kind: binding time (TTL), owner (only owner death","ends it), or hybrid (owner-bound plus idle or max_lifetime); ttl, renew,","max_lifetime, grace, idle, reclaim_live_owner and action destroy|report. Shells",never reclaim on TTL while their owner is alive or unknown. Idle/max_lifetime,"reclaim a live owner only with reclaim_live_owner: true on a hybrid row; an",unknown owner is never reclaimed. The lease records its policy.,"--ttl must fit max_lifetime; --idle D and --max-lifetime D may only tighten the","row. Off, --idle and --max-lifetime exit 2 naming the setting.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Consumer contract 1 is off until DIBS_CONSUMER_CONTRACT=1 or \"consumer_contract\":","true in the user config. While off, reconcile, reclaim, explain, --pending and","--key exit 2 naming the setting, and extend and release behave as described above.","While on, these commands and extend and release follow contract 1:","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refusal, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, resource_unknown, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown,","expired, owner_dead, job_deadline, max_lifetime, grace, resource_busy.",Extend success is renewed or reattached.,"Exit 1 is only for operation failures. Output carries contract: 1.",See docs/consumer-contract.md.,"","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs create [--owner KIND:ID] [--ttl 8h] [--stale 15m]"
